{"2840910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pizza Delivery Survivors", "steam_appid": 2840910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "Pizza Delivery Survivors<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience the thrill of pizza delivery in a zombie apocalypse! In &quot;Pizza Delivery Survivors,&quot; you are a pizza delivery driver navigating a city overrun by zombies. This game offers a unique blend of survival, strategy, and fast-paced action. Deliver pizzas, outsmart the undead, and survive in a world where your daily job becomes a fight for survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDynamic Gameplay: Engage in high-intensity pizza delivery missions while dodging and outwitting hordes of zombies. Every delivery is a thrilling adventure of survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExpansive Arsenal of Weapons:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMop: Turn your trusty cleaning tool into a makeshift weapon against zombies.<br />\r\nPizza Wheel: Slice through zombie crowds with this culinary tool.<br />\r\nUnlimited Breadsticks Basket: Shoot breadsticks at high speed to fend off the undead.<br />\r\nCheese Shakers: Shake some cheese in the hordes of faces.<br />\r\nOven Drop: Deploy ovens from above for a smashing impact.<br />\r\nBroken Pizza Sign: Electrify zombies with this unexpectedly potent weapon.<br />\r\nFuture Development Plans:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInteractive Environment for Item Spawns: Discover objects in the game world, like abandoned cars and fire hydrants, that players can interact with to find useful items or uncover hidden secrets.<br />\r\nSynergistic Weapon Upgrades: Enhance your arsenal with new weapons and upgrades that create dynamic synergies between existing weapons.<br />\r\nDelivery Encounters System: Engage in meaningful interactions with customers during deliveries, with choices affecting outcomes and branching the story.<br />\r\nNight Shift Mode: Tackle more challenging missions in remote or complex locations with unique enemy behaviors.<br />\r\nNew Cities and Day Shifts: Unlock new environments with distinct challenges by achieving specific in-game goals.<br />\r\nEnhanced Player Progression: Gain additional health upgrades and abilities, allowing for more tailored survival strategies.", "about_the_game": "Pizza Delivery Survivors<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience the thrill of pizza delivery in a zombie apocalypse! In &quot;Pizza Delivery Survivors,&quot; you are a pizza delivery driver navigating a city overrun by zombies. This game offers a unique blend of survival, strategy, and fast-paced action. Deliver pizzas, outsmart the undead, and survive in a world where your daily job becomes a fight for survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDynamic Gameplay: Engage in high-intensity pizza delivery missions while dodging and outwitting hordes of zombies. Every delivery is a thrilling adventure of survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExpansive Arsenal of Weapons:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMop: Turn your trusty cleaning tool into a makeshift weapon against zombies.<br />\r\nPizza Wheel: Slice through zombie crowds with this culinary tool.<br />\r\nUnlimited Breadsticks Basket: Shoot breadsticks at high speed to fend off the undead.<br />\r\nCheese Shakers: Shake some cheese in the hordes of faces.<br />\r\nOven Drop: Deploy ovens from above for a smashing impact.<br />\r\nBroken Pizza Sign: Electrify zombies with this unexpectedly potent weapon.<br />\r\nFuture Development Plans:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInteractive Environment for Item Spawns: Discover objects in the game world, like abandoned cars and fire hydrants, that players can interact with to find useful items or uncover hidden secrets.<br />\r\nSynergistic Weapon Upgrades: Enhance your arsenal with new weapons and upgrades that create dynamic synergies between existing weapons.<br />\r\nDelivery Encounters System: Engage in meaningful interactions with customers during deliveries, with choices affecting outcomes and branching the story.<br />\r\nNight Shift Mode: Tackle more challenging missions in remote or complex locations with unique enemy behaviors.<br />\r\nNew Cities and Day Shifts: Unlock new environments with distinct challenges by achieving specific in-game goals.<br />\r\nEnhanced Player Progression: Gain additional health upgrades and abilities, allowing for more tailored survival strategies.", "short_description": "Experience the thrill of pizza delivery in a zombie apocalypse! &quot;Pizza Delivery Survivors&quot; combines survival, strategy, and fast-paced action. Deliver pizzas, outsmart the undead, and turn everyday items into weapons to fight for survival.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840910/header.jpg?t=1785915622", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840910/6a560616f16a6bb913bb33ce64a38a0e2b95995f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785915622", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840910/6a560616f16a6bb913bb33ce64a38a0e2b95995f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785915622", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 6200</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Conglomerated Industries"], "publishers": ["Conglomerated Industries"], "demos": [{"appid": 3106040, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 999, "final": 999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$9.99"}, "packages": [1013687], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Pizza Delivery Survivors"